        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>金陵十二钗正册判词</title>\n  <script>\n    window.MathJax = { tex: { inlineMath: [['$', '$']], displayMath: [['$$', '$$']] } };\n  </script>\n  <script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n  <style>\n    * { box-sizing: border-box; }\n    body {\n      margin: 0;\n      background: #eee8d8;\n      color: #9b5145;\n      font-family: \"KaiTi\", \"STKaiti\", \"FangSong\", serif;\n    }\n    .page {\n      width: min(100%, 540px);\n      min-height: 697px;\n      margin: 0 auto;\n      padding: 8px 10px 13px;\n      overflow: hidden;\n      background-color: #f7f4e9;\n      background-image:\n        linear-gradient(rgba(187, 151, 126, .22) 1px, transparent 1px),\n        linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(187, 151, 126, .22) 1px, transparent 1px);\n      background-size: 16px 16px;\n    }\n    h1 {\n      width: max-content;\n      max-width: 100%;\n      margin: 0 auto 11px;\n      padding: 2px 7px 1px;\n      border: 1px solid #c99d90;\n      color: #ad5344;\n      font-size: 21px;\n      line-height: 1.18;\n      font-weight: bold;\n      letter-spacing: 2px;\n    }\n    .grid {\n      display: grid;\n      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));\n      grid-auto-rows: 158px;\n      column-gap: 3px;\n      row-gap: 11px;\n    }\n    .entry {\n      position: relative;\n      min-width: 0;\n    }\n    .placeholder {\n      position: absolute;\n      z-index: 2;\n      left: 0;\n      top: -8px;\n      width: 59px;\n      height: 123px;\n      overflow: hidden;\n      background-position: center bottom;\n      background-repeat: no-repeat;\n      background-size: contain;\n    }\n    .placeholder span { display: none; }\n    .panel {\n      position: absolute;\n      left: 54px;\n      right: 1px;\n      top: 6px;\n      min-height: 105px;\n      padding: 6px 4px 4px 12px;\n      border: 1px solid rgba(181, 113, 101, .62);\n      background: rgba(250, 247, 237, .25);\n      font-size: 14px;\n      line-height: 1.47;\n      white-space: nowrap;\n    }\n    .name {\n      display: block;\n      margin-bottom: 1px;\n      font-weight: bold;\n      font-size: 13px;\n      letter-spacing: 1px;\n    }\n    .p1 .placeholder {\n      background-image: linear-gradient(155deg, transparent 37%, #1c2924 38% 45%, transparent 46%), linear-gradient(72deg, transparent 39%, #e9f0e3 40% 68%, transparent 69%);\n    }\n    .p2 .placeholder {\n      background-image: linear-gradient(130deg, transparent 38%, #33251c 39% 51%, transparent 52%), linear-gradient(70deg, transparent 34%, #f3a8b7 35% 72%, transparent 73%);\n    }\n    .p3 .placeholder {\n      background-image: linear-gradient(155deg, transparent 34%, #3d2415 35% 53%, transparent 54%), linear-gradient(80deg, transparent 35%, #df9232 36% 71%, transparent 72%);\n    }\n    .p4 .placeholder, .p5 .placeholder, .p6 .placeholder {\n      background-image: linear-gradient(150deg, transparent 37%, #33251c 38% 52%, transparent 53%), linear-gradient(80deg, transparent 35%, #e9b537 36% 73%, transparent 74%);\n    }\n    .p5 .placeholder { background-image: linear-gradient(150deg, transparent 37%, #2e241f 38% 52%, transparent 53%), linear-gradient(80deg, transparent 35%, #e8bdd2 36% 73%, transparent 74%); }\n    .p6 .placeholder { background-image: linear-gradient(150deg, transparent 37%, #282427 38% 52%, transparent 53%), linear-gradient(80deg, transparent 35%, #d51e27 36% 73%, transparent 74%); }\n    .p7 .placeholder { background-image: linear-gradient(150deg, transparent 37%, #32231e 38% 52%, transparent 53%), linear-gradient(80deg, transparent 35%, #edcf5d 36% 73%, transparent 74%); }\n    .p8 .placeholder { background-image: linear-gradient(150deg, transparent 37%, #39261e 38% 52%, transparent 53%), linear-gradient(80deg, transparent 35%, #df1e29 36% 73%, transparent 74%); }\n    .p9 .placeholder { background-image: linear-gradient(150deg, transparent 37%, #36251c 38% 52%, transparent 53%), linear-gradient(80deg, transparent 35%, #dc7d7c 36% 73%, transparent 74%); }\n    .p10 .placeholder { background-image: linear-gradient(150deg, transparent 37%, #1a292d 38% 52%, transparent 53%), linear-gradient(80deg, transparent 35%, #a68fd0 36% 73%, transparent 74%); }\n    .p11 .placeholder { background-image: linear-gradient(150deg, transparent 37%, #35231d 38% 52%, transparent 53%), linear-gradient(80deg, transparent 35%, #dd2440 36% 73%, transparent 74%); }\n    .p12 .placeholder { background-image: linear-gradient(150deg, transparent 37%, #272326 38% 52%, transparent 53%), linear-gradient(80deg, transparent 35%, #a68bd4 36% 73%, transparent 74%); }\n    @media (max-width: 430px) {\n      .page { padding: 7px 5px; }\n      .grid { grid-auto-rows: 155px; column-gap: 0; }\n      .panel { left: 48px; padding-left: 7px; font-size: 12px; }\n      .placeholder { width: 53px; }\n      .name { font-size: 12px; }\n    }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <main class=\"page\">\n    <h1>金陵十二钗正册判词</h1>\n    <section class=\"grid\">\n      <article class=\"entry p1\">\n        <div class=\"placeholder\"><span>[Illustration: 林黛玉]</span></div>\n        <div class=\"panel\"><span class=\"name\">林黛玉（情情）</span>可叹停机德，<br>堪怜咏絮才。<br>玉带林中挂，<br>金簪雪里埋。</div>\n      </article>\n      <article class=\"entry p2\">\n        <div class=\"placeholder\"><span>[Illustration: 薛宝钗]</span></div>\n        <div class=\"panel\"><span class=\"name\">薛宝钗（无情）</span>可叹停机德，<br>堪怜咏絮才。<br>玉带林中挂，<br>金簪雪里埋。</div>\n      </article>\n      <article class=\"entry p3\">\n        <div class=\"placeholder\"><span>[Illustration: 王熙凤]</span></div>\n        <div class=\"panel\"><span class=\"name\">王熙凤（协理）</span>凡鸟偏从末世来，<br>都知爱慕此生才。<br>一从二令三人木，<br>哭向金陵事更哀。</div>\n      </article>\n      <article class=\"entry p4\">\n        <div class=\"placeholder\"><span>[Illustration: 贾元春]</span></div>\n        <div class=\"panel\"><span class=\"name\">贾元春（情宫）</span>二十年来辨是非，<br>榴花开处照宫闱。<br>三春争及初春景，<br>虎兕相逢大梦归。</div>\n      </article>\n      <article class=\"entry p5\">\n        <div class=\"placeholder\"><span>[Illustration: 贾迎春]</span></div>\n        <div class=\"panel\"><span class=\"name\">贾迎春（懦弱）</span>子系中山狼，<br>得志便猖狂。<br>金闺花柳质，<br>一载赴黄粱。</div>\n      </article>\n      <article class=\"entry p6\">\n        <div class=\"placeholder\"><span>[Illustration: 贾探春]</span></div>\n        <div class=\"panel\"><span class=\"name\">贾探春（敏探）</span>才自精明志自高，<br>生于末世运偏消。<br>清明涕送江边望，<br>千里东风一梦遥。</div>\n      </article>\n      <article class=\"entry p7\">\n        <div class=\"placeholder\"><span>[Illustration: 史湘云]</span></div>\n        <div class=\"panel\"><span class=\"name\">史湘云（情友）</span>富贵又何为？<br>襁褓之间父母违。<br>展眼吊斜晖，<br>湘江水逝楚云飞。</div>\n      </article>\n      <article class=\"entry p8\">\n        <div class=\"placeholder\"><span>[Illustration: 妙玉]</span></div>\n        <div class=\"panel\"><span class=\"name\">妙玉（情洁）</span>欲洁何曾洁，<br>云空未必空。<br>可怜金玉质，<br>终陷淖泥中。</div>\n      </article>\n      <article class=\"entry p9\">\n        <div class=\"placeholder\"><span>[Illustration: 贾惜春]</span></div>\n        <div class=\"panel\"><span class=\"name\">贾惜春（勘破）</span>勘破三春景不长，<br>缁衣顿改昔年妆。<br>可怜绣户侯门女，<br>独卧青灯古佛旁。</div>\n      </article>\n      <article class=\"entry p10\">\n        <div class=\"placeholder\"><span>[Illustration: 巧姐]</span></div>\n        <div class=\"panel\"><span class=\"name\">巧姐（险境）</span>势败休云贵，<br>家亡莫论亲。<br>偶因济刘氏，<br>巧得遇恩人。</div>\n      </article>\n      <article class=\"entry p11\">\n        <div class=\"placeholder\"><span>[Illustration: 李纨]</span></div>\n        <div class=\"panel\"><span class=\"name\">李纨（情纺）</span>桃李春风结子完，<br>到头谁似一盆兰。<br>如冰水好空相妒，<br>枉与他人作笑谈。</div>\n      </article>\n      <article class=\"entry p12\">\n        <div class=\"placeholder\"><span>[Illustration: 秦可卿]</span></div>\n        <div class=\"panel\"><span class=\"name\">秦可卿（情天）</span>情天情海幻情身，<br>情既相逢必主淫。<br>漫言不肖皆荣出，<br>造衅开端实在宁。</div>\n      </article>\n    </section>\n  </main>\n</body>\n</html>"
